{
  "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.92,
      "size": 46656,
      "text": "球面上三角形内角和大于一百八十度，超出的部分等于面积。这是吉拉尔定理。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.88,
      "size": 46080,
      "text": "平面上内角和恰好一百八十度，而面积与角度完全无关，随便多大都行。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.82,
      "size": 61056,
      "text": "双曲平面上会怎样？答案是小于一百八十度，而且不足的那部分同样等于面积。这个差额叫角亏。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "defect",
      "line_id": "df-1",
      "filename": "defect-df-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/defect-df-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.14,
      "size": 50256,
      "text": "双曲三角形的面积公式是圆周率减去内角和。注意它与球面版本的顺序正好相反。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "defect",
      "line_id": "df-2",
      "filename": "defect-df-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/defect-df-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.69,
      "size": 59040,
      "text": "两个式子可以合成一个：面积等于内角和减圆周率的绝对值，再除以曲率的绝对值。这就是高斯-博内定理。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "defect",
      "line_id": "df-3",
      "filename": "defect-df-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/defect-df-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.43,
      "size": 70848,
      "text": "屏幕上把三个内角、内角和、角亏、面积全部列出。角亏与面积两个数字精确相同，误差在十的负十二次方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "bound",
      "line_id": "bd-1",
      "filename": "bound-bd-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/bound-bd-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.5,
      "size": 56016,
      "text": "既然面积等于圆周率减内角和，而内角至少为零，那么面积最多就是圆周率。这是个惊人的限制。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "bound",
      "line_id": "bd-2",
      "filename": "bound-bd-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/bound-bd-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.33,
      "size": 53280,
      "text": "换句话说，双曲平面上不存在任意大的三角形。无论怎么撑，面积都进不了圆周率这道门。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "bound",
      "line_id": "bd-3",
      "filename": "bound-bd-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/bound-bd-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.35,
      "size": 53568,
      "text": "请拖动顶点半径到接近一。三个内角依次趋于零，面积读数逼近三点一四一五，但永远差那么一点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "counter",
      "line_id": "ct-1",
      "filename": "counter-ct-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/counter-ct-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.45,
      "size": 55152,
      "text": "还有一个反欧氏直觉的现象。在平面上把三角形放大，角度不变；在球面上放大，角度变大。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "counter",
      "line_id": "ct-2",
      "filename": "counter-ct-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/counter-ct-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.91,
      "size": 46512,
      "text": "双曲平面上正好相反：边越长，角反而越小。负曲率让三角形往里瘪下去。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "counter",
      "line_id": "ct-3",
      "filename": "counter-ct-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/counter-ct-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.28,
      "size": 52416,
      "text": "屏幕上的读数验证了这点：半径从零点三加到零点九，三边长度显著增加，而三个内角同步减小。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "unify",
      "line_id": "uf-1",
      "filename": "unify-uf-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/unify-uf-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.54,
      "size": 56592,
      "text": "现在把三种几何并排看。曲率为正一的球面：面积等于内角和减圆周率，内角和大于圆周率。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "unify",
      "line_id": "uf-2",
      "filename": "unify-uf-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/unify-uf-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.98,
      "size": 47664,
      "text": "曲率为零的平面：面积与角度无关，内角和恰等于圆周率。这是唯一的临界情形。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "unify",
      "line_id": "uf-3",
      "filename": "unify-uf-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/unify-uf-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.89,
      "size": 62208,
      "text": "曲率为负一的双曲平面：面积等于圆周率减内角和，内角和小于圆周率。三者其实是同一条定理的三个特例。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.01,
      "size": 48096,
      "text": "第一，双曲三角形内角和小于一百八十度，不足的部分叫角亏，数值上等于面积。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.52,
      "size": 40320,
      "text": "第二，面积有上界圆周率，三个角都趋于零时逼近但永不达到。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "hyperbolic-triangle",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/hyperbolic-triangle/yunxi/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.33,
      "size": 53280,
      "text": "第三，球面盈余与双曲角亏是同一条高斯-博内定理的两个镜像。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
